<title>USA: IPO FILING-NetSource Communications Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-NetSource Communications Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			NetSource Communications Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			NSCE.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $13-$15/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered in U.S.	     2.8 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered in Canada/Europe  0.7 million Shrs outstanding after ipo    19,478,074</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Deutsche Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  525,000 shrs Business: San Francisco, Calif., company develops, implements and manages a wide range of communications solutions for business and end-user customers worldwide. Products and services include international and domestic long distance telecommunications. Use of Proceeds: For capital expenditures, including telecommunications network upgrade and expansion and establishment of Internet backbond, working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				  1995	     1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $91,299	 $53,852</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)   ($1,834)	($1,998)</p>
